  "Description": {
    "Cost": 12501010,
    "UIName": "Grond",
    "Id": "chassisdef_grond_GND-C",
    "Name": "Grond",
    "Details": "The C configuration equips the Grond with a balanced mix of firepower and precision. Four Improved Gauss Rifles provide sustained ballistic damage, while two i-AC/10s with Ares TPS Attachments deliver rapid, pinpoint bursts aided by advanced predictive targeting. Complementing these are four Early Clan Extended-Range Medium Lasers, optimized for reliable performance at medium range. The integrated PHI Suite enhances coordinated sensor targeting. Designed for flexible frontline roles, the C loadout balances ranged ballistic fire with energy support, leveraging superior targeting systems to maximize hit probability despite the Grond’s typical heat management challenges common to Minnesota Tribe superheavies.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.4</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Grond"
  },
