  "StockRole": "Superheavy Clan Omni",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Grond is a massive 175-ton OmniMech built by Hallowed Iron Assembly for the Minnesota Tribe, visually resembling a larger Stone Rhino. Equipped with an Endo-Steel frame, a potent 350-rating XL engine, and Plasmo-Electric Heat Sinks, it expertly manages heat from its devastating energy weapons. Designed foremost as an offensive alpha-striker, the Grond unleashes overwhelming, high-impact volleys to shatter enemy defenses quickly. Its imposing presence and raw power embody the Tribe’s doctrine of relentless, decisive firepower, making it a terrifying force that dominates the battlefield with swift, crushing strikes.",
